# b/305401356: Update portage to pick up recent fixes before updating rest of
# chroot. We force binpkgs, because building from source will trigger the bug
# we're trying to avoid. Ignore errors, because we can only do harm by failing
# here. The rest of `update_chroot` should try (and, possibly, fail) the same
# upgrade.
sudo emerge --update --getbinpkg --getbinpkgonly -j8 sys-apps/portage || :
